         KEEP HERE — SHARED
         Used by src/pages/news.astro (the ".cards" grid wrapper).
         Homepage hero/intro/home-cards/closing/FAQ styles used to be
         duplicated here too — removed since src/pages/index.astro
         already has its own scoped copies of all of them.
         ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */

      .cards {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
        gap: 0.5rem;
      }
